e}", "releases_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AeroRust/mav/releases{/id}", "deployments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AeroRust/mav/deployments", "created_at": "2020-12-05T18:00:29Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-20T10:07:50Z", "pushed_at": "2024-09-22T13:53:17Z", "git_url": "git://github.com/AeroRust/mav.git", "ssh_url": "git@github.com:AeroRust/mav.git", "clone_url": "https://github.com/AeroRust/mav.git", "svn_url": "https://github.com/AeroRust/mav", "homepage": "http://aerorust.org/mav/", "size": 6117, "stargazers_count": 34, "watchers_count": 34, "language": "Rust", "has_issues": true, "has_projects": true, "has_downloads": false, "has_wiki": false, "has_pages": true, "has_discussions": false, "forks_count": 11, "mirror_url": null, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "open_issues_count": 7, "license": null, "allow_forking": true, "is_template": false, "web_commit_signoff_required": false, "has_pull_requests": true, "pull_request_creation_policy": "all", "topics": ["drones", "hacktoberfest", "robotics", "rustlang", "simulation"], "visibility": "public", "forks": 11, "open_issues": 7, "watchers": 34, "default_branch": "main", "permissions": {"admin": false, "maintain": false, "push": false, "triage": false, "pull": true}}, "body": "I've recently asked in the ArduPilot community on Discord if it's possible to use `MAVSDK` for ArduPilot.\r\nApparently, the `MAVSDK` server is hardcoded for `PX4` specifically and there might be more than a few differences.\r\n\r\nThis should be explored so that we can see what it would take to use the `MAVSDK` server for ArduPilot.\r\n\r\n> Basically mavsdk will runtime detect which autopilot it connects to, but some functionality is hardcoded to px4 - for instance Ardupilot uses waypoint 0 to store the home location, so missions are effectively indexed from 1. Px4 doesn\u2019t, so missions are indexed from 0. Takeoff, land, etc should work.\r\n\r\n### ArduPilot related issues for its support in the MAVSDK server:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/205\r\n- https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/728\r\n- https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1568\r\n- https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1445", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AeroRust/mav/issues/4/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AeroRust/mav/issues/4/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "pinned_comment": null}}, "event": "cross-referenced"}, {"id": 5897217255, "node_id": "REFE_lADOBabE0s4Q4wguzwAAAAFfgGTn", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/events/5897217255", "actor": {"login": "dlech", "id": 963645, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzY0NQ==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/963645?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech", "html_url": "https://github.com/dlech", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dlech/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "event": "referenced", "commit_id": "5f1f2123985c0effcfb3226962d5a850ca96444a", "commit_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dlech/MAVSDK/commits/5f1f2123985c0effcfb3226962d5a850ca96444a", "created_at": "2022-01-14T20:44:21Z", "performed_via_github_app": null}], "fetched_at": "2026-08-28T20:37:25Z"}